 <p><p>Haye Bimaar haye darbar - 3</p>

<p>Samne darbar ke ghairate Sajjad ka hai yeh kaisa imtehaan - 2<br />
<br />
Teen din guzre khari hain x2, Fatima ki betiyaan</p>

<p>1. Shaam waaley has rahe hain, bekaso ko dekh kar<br />
Hai charagha(n) chaar soo aur, saj rahe hai bamo-dar<br />
Baabe sa&rsquo;at par ruka hai, bekaso ka carava(n)</p>

<p>2. Khoon rota hai jo Abid, us ko ye ehsaas hai<br />
Fatima Zehra ki chaadar, shamiyon ke paas hai<br />
Dekh kar kehti hai Zainab, mere Ghazi ho kahan</p>

<p>3. Sar Ali Akbar ka neze par uthate hain shaqee<br />
Sun chuki satrah azaane, berida binte Ali<br />
Ro rahi hain har azaan sun, ker Ali Akbar ki maa</p>

<p>4. Misle Zehra sar jhukaye shaamiyon me aa gayi<br />
Chaar barson mein Sakina par za&rsquo;eefi chaa gayi<br />
Kaan bhi zakhmi hain galo, par tamachon ke nishan</p>

<p>5. Khoon ke aansoon tapakte, hain sar e Shabbir se<br />
Poochti hai jab Sakina, Zainab-e-dilgeer se<br />
Aye phupi amma yahan se, kab chalega carava(n)</p>

<p>6. Sab se mushkil merhala Sajjad pe Yawar ye tha<br />
Shaam ke darbaar me jab, qaafila jaane laga<br />
Parh rahee thi(n) inna lillah, us ghari sab bibiyaan</p>

<p>Samne Darbar Ke Ghairate Sajjad Ka</p>
